  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to increase access to and improve the quality of urban infrastructure and services in the country#s two largest cities, Abidjan and Bouak#.  The achievement of this objective would support GoCI#s efforts to demonstrate visible and tangible improvements in the lives of its citizens, a critical step for sustaining social and political stability and economic recovery in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
